{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf028:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 28, "folio": 2345, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "«Ар-жагыңдан сөзү жоксуң,", "text": "«Ар-жагыңдан сөзү жоксуң,", "en": "“In every respect you are beyond reproach,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening phrase is especially difficult.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf028:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 28, "folio": 2345, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Бузулгандан оңдосоң,", "text": "Бузулгандан оңдосоң,", "en": "If you mend what has been broken,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Verb ending is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf028:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 28, "folio": 2345, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Эм Кыяздан кекти толгом,", "text": "Эм Кыяздан кекти толгом,", "en": "Now I am filled with vengeance against Kıyas,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Object and final verb are hard to distinguish.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf028:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 28, "folio": 2345, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Сайгандан кобойсом,", "text": "Сайгандан кобойсом,", "en": "If I rise after being struck,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Entire baseline is difficult; reading is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf028:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 28, "folio": 2345, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Элиңе барсаң кечирип,", "text": "Элиңе барсаң кечирип,", "en": "If you return to your people, forgive,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Pronoun and verb are faint.", "bbox": null}
